{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "godunov_upwind_D1",
    "description": "Pointwise Godunov-upwind one-sided derivative combination max(dl, 0) - min(dr, 0) from the backward difference dl and the forward difference dr along one axis: fire_behavior's diff2 of the classical Godunov option (Calc_tend_ls case 4, fire_upwinding = 4), used there as the per-axis 'derivative' that the front normal nvx = diff2x/sqrt(|grad psi|^2 + eps) is built from. NOTE (fire_behavior N44 in the EqWeFiC bug list): for a monotone field this equals |u_x| to first order -- a MAGNITUDE, not a signed derivative (dl > 0, dr > 0 gives dl; dl < 0, dr < 0 gives -dr > 0) -- so a consumer that wants the signed normal must supply the sign separately; the rules of this grid expose the quantity exactly as the reference code computes it. Exact on a linear field with positive slope; first order otherwise. Match-less helper of godunov_upwind_D1x_interior / godunov_upwind_D1y_interior.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:x",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Osher, S., & Sethian, J. A. (1988). Fronts propagating with curvature-dependent speed: Algorithms based on Hamilton-Jacobi formulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 79(1), 12-49.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(88)90002-2"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls, Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Select_godunov (case 4), Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [],
  "expression_templates": {
    "godunov_upwind_D1": {
      "params": [
        "dl",
        "dr"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              "dl",
              0
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "min",
            "args": [
              "dr",
              0
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
